            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Platforms</th>
              <td>Every feature on all four</td>
              <td class="lp-compare-pick">Table stakes everywhere, Apple frameworks on the Mac</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Sharing</th>
              <td>Becoming your library</td>
              <td class="lp-compare-pick">Immich, and export that works local or remote</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Input</th>
