              <td class="lp-compare-pick">Open source, the whole app</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2>What the list is actually for</h2>
      <p>
        None of this has dates on it. I build LightPhotos in bursts, and a
        roadmap with quarters on it would be a work of fiction.
      </p>
      <p>
        What the list does is give me something to say no against. The first
        version shipped because seven items were written down and everything
        else was out of scope. This is the same list, one size up.
      </p>
      <p>
        It's also a list I'd like to be argued with. If something here is
        wrong, or something obvious is missing, log it at
        <a href="https://github.com/andrewyao/lightphotos-app/issues">the issue
        tracker</a> and I'll read it.
      </p>
      <p>
        The current builds are on the <a href="/downloads.html">downloads
        page</a>, and the browser version is at <a href="/app.html">the web
        app</a> if you want to try it without installing anything.
      </p>




